{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35589","headline":"除夜 · 来鹄","name":"除夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"事关休戚已成空，万里相思一夜中。\n愁到晓鸡声绝後，又将顦顇见春风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"来鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「除夜」条，撰者罗　玲、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"罗 玲"}